     Drawer: `<Drawer.Root isOpen onOpenChange><Drawer.Trigger className="button button--primary">請求書を編集</Drawer.Trigger><Drawer.Backdrop variant="opaque"><Drawer.Content placement="right"><Drawer.Dialog><Drawer.CloseTrigger aria-label="編集を閉じる" /><Drawer.Header><Drawer.Heading>請求書を編集</Drawer.Heading></Drawer.Header><Drawer.Body><Form className="drawer-form" onSubmit={...} validationBehavior="aria">` with failure Alert + 3 TextFields (顧客名 Input; 支払期限 `<Input type="date" />`; メモ Input) each with `Label`/`Description`/`FieldError`; `<Drawer.Footer className="drawer-actions">` with tertiary「キャンセル」and primary「変更を保存」(`isDisabled={isSaving} isPending={isSaving} onPress={submitDraft}`).
     AlertDialog: `<AlertDialog.Root isOpen onOpenChange><AlertDialog.Trigger><Button variant="danger-soft">請求書を無効化</Button></AlertDialog.Trigger><AlertDialog.Backdrop variant="opaque"><AlertDialog.Container><AlertDialog.Dialog><AlertDialog.Icon status="danger" /><AlertDialog.Header><AlertDialog.Heading>請求書を無効化</AlertDialog.Heading></AlertDialog.Header><AlertDialog.Body className="dialog-body">` with `{invoice.invoiceNumber}（{current.customerName}／{formatAmount(invoice.amount)}）を無効化します。` + 「無効化した請求書は元に戻せません。一覧にも表示されなくなります。」 + optional failure Alert; `<AlertDialog.Footer>` tertiary「キャンセル」+ danger「無効化する」.
     Content: `<div className="detail-grid">` with a success Alert when `saveStatus === "saved"`, then 3 Cards (請求内容 with 6 DetailFields; 明細 as `<ul className="detail-content plain-list">` of `.line-item`; メモ).

4. Errors and fixes:
   - **Probe (prior session)**: bare HeroUI `<Link href="#/invoices/abc">` inside `HashRouter` changed `window.location.hash` but did NOT re-render synchronously under jsdom, so `screen.getByRole("heading", …)` threw. **Fix**: add `onPress={() => navigate(path)}` alongside `href`; probe then passed both assertions. Adopted as the navigation pattern via `useHashNavigation()`.
   - **`react-aria-components` package layout**: `node_modules/react-aria-components/dist/Button.d.ts` does not exist (pnpm store layout: `node_modules/.pnpm/react-aria-components@1.21.0_.../node_modules/react-aria-components/dist/types/src/Button.d.ts`). Could not confirm RAC Button supports the `form` attribute. **Fix/decision**: avoid `form={id}` entirely — place `Form` inside `Drawer.Body` (as the drawer contract requires) and have the footer save Button call `submitDraft` via `onPress`, with the Form's `onSubmit` handling the Enter key.
   - **`components/text-field` path wrong**: HeroUI's directory is `components/textfield/` (no hyphen). Corrected the lookup.
   - **`AlertDialog.Trigger` renders `<Pressable><div role="button">`**: nesting a HeroUI Button inside (as both the Atlas contract and `atlas/action-confirmation` require) produces two elements with role="button" and the same accessible name. **Planned mitigation in tests**: use `getAllByRole("button", { name: "請求書を無効化" })[0]` rather than `getByRole`.
   - **Large `cat` output persisted to file** (prior session): fixed by reading in smaller batches / parsing with inline `python3`.

5. Problem Solving:

   Binding lint constraints derived from reading `eslint-plugin-atlas` source (all still apply):
   - `atlas/component-approved`: no native `button`/`table`/`select`/`input` JSX tags; no `role="dialog"`; only these 21 `@heroui/react` named imports (type imports exempt): `Button, Link, Table, Toolbar, SearchField, Card, Form, TextField, Label, Description, FieldError, Input, Select, ListBox, Chip, Surface, Drawer, AlertDialog, Alert, Toast, toast`. The whole source text is scanned for 7 forbidden strings: `Atlas Billing`, `ワークスペース`, `請求書を作成`, `入金消込`, `帳票出力`, `メール送付`, `月次レポート` (avoid anywhere, including comments).
   - `atlas/component-usage`: JSX base names `Link`, `Toolbar`, `AlertDialog`, `Table` must all appear.
   - `atlas/component-variants`: variant literals must be in the allow-list; a non-literal `variant` is itself an error (hence `StatusChip`'s switch). Allowed: Button `[primary, secondary, tertiary, outline, ghost, danger, danger-soft]`; Card `[default, secondary, tertiary, transparent]`; Chip `[primary, secondary, tertiary, soft]`; Input `[primary, secondary]`; Link `[default]`; SearchField `[primary, secondary]`; Surface `[default, secondary, tertiary, transparent]`; Table.Root `[primary]`; Toolbar `[default, attached]`; Drawer.Backdrop/AlertDialog.Backdrop `[opaque, blur, transparent]`.
   - `atlas/table-variant`: `Table.Root` must exist; variant `primary` or omitted.
   - `atlas/form-label`: at least one `Label`/`Label.*` element or an `aria-label` attribute.
   - `atlas/contact-email` (configured `type: "date"`): needs an `Input`/`TextField` element AND a literal `type="date"` attribute.
   - `atlas/link-semantics`: (a) the first `Table.Cell` whose source text contains `invoice.invoiceNumber` must match `<(?:Link|RouterLink)\b[^>]*(?:href|to)=`; (b) a `Link`/`RouterLink` with href/to inside an ancestor whose `className` contains `collection-list-mobile`; (c) a `Link`/`RouterLink` with href/to whose text matches `請求書一覧(?:へ|に)戻る`; (d) NO `Button` element whose source text matches `invoice\.invoiceNumber|請求書を確認|請求書一覧(?:へ|に)戻る`.
   - `atlas/action-confirmation` (`無効化|voidInvoice`): `AlertDialog.Root` + ≥1 `AlertDialog.Trigger`, one Trigger containing a `Button`.
   - `atlas/focus-management`: `Drawer.Root` + `Drawer.Backdrop` + ≥1 `Drawer.Trigger` **with a `className`** and **no nested `Button`** + ≥1 `Drawer.CloseTrigger`, and **every** `Drawer.CloseTrigger` must have only whitespace direct JSXText children.
   - `atlas/no-raw-color` (src CSS): no `#hex`, `rgb()`, `rgba()`, `hsl()`, `hsla()`.
   - `atlas/component-theme-import` (`src/styles.css`): must `@import` a path containing `design/component-theme.css`.

   Design decisions adopted (to record in the final report):
   - Navigation uses HeroUI `<Link href={hashHref(path)} onPress={(e) => goTo(path, e)}>` (real anchor + synchronous client routing; modifier-key presses fall through to the browser).
   - 明細 is rendered as a `.line-item` list, NOT a second `Table`, to avoid conflicting with the single `component.table.columns` contract from `example.invoice-management`.
   - Added one extra, non-required screen state `void-failure` (URL-only, no UI) so the void-failure branch is genuinely reachable and testable; the 8 required states are all implemented.
   - `?state=failure` seeds `saveStatus="failed"` + error text AND `simulateSaveFailure` ref = true (consumed on first submit), so retry from that state fails once more then succeeds.
   - Detail page uses 3 Cards: 請求内容 (incl. 支払期限 and ステータス), 明細, メモ.
   - Field label for 入金状況 is 「ステータス」 to match the list column header (ui-writing: 同じ対象を別の語で呼ばない).
   - Confirm button label is 「無効化する」 per the Example contract (which overrides ui-writing's サ変動詞 rule since the contract is authoritative).

6. All user messages:
   - "`brief.md`の要件を実装してください。\n\n`HARNESS.json`が存在する場合は、`$atlas-design-system`、`$heroui-react`、`$ui-writing`を使って実装してください。実装前に`HARNESS_RESOLVED.json`と`DESIGN.md`を読み、解決済みのpattern、variant、example、component、ruleを正として扱います。HeroUIのAPI、compound component、標準スタイルは`heroui-react`、Atlasで許可する選択肢は設計契約、日本語UI文言は`ui-writing`に従ってください。参照したIDと採用した判断を最終報告へ記録してください。\n\n`HARNESS.json`が存在しない場合は`brief.md`だけを入力として実装してください。どちらの条件でも既存ファイルの責務を保ち、必要な画面状態と機能を実装し、利用可能な検証コマンド（`pnpm lint`、`pnpm typecheck`、`pnpm test:run`、`pnpm build`）を実行してエラーを解消してください。依存関係は追加しないでください。"

   (No other user-role messages; everything else is tool results and system reminders.)

7. Pending Tasks:
   - Rewrite `src/App.tsx` to import `InvoiceListPage` / `InvoiceDetailPage` from the new modules, keep the `HashRouter` + `/invoices` + `/invoices/:invoiceId` + `*` routes, and mount `<Toast.Provider />`.
   - Add/extend tests (TDD per project rules) covering: list→detail navigation (existing test must pass unchanged), empty state, drawer-open, invalid-due-date, loading, success, failure + retry, void-confirm success (toast + navigate to `/invoices`), void failure + retry. Use `resetInvoiceRecords()` in `afterEach`. Remember `getAllByRole("button", {name:"請求書を無効化"})[0]` due to the nested role=button in `AlertDialog.Trigger`.
   - Run and fix `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm test:run`, `pnpm build`.
   - Write the final report in Japanese recording referenced Atlas IDs (`pattern.page-layout#collection-table`, `pattern.page-layout#single-one-column`, `pattern.spacing-layout#page-content`, `pattern.spacing-layout#dialog-content`, `pattern.visual-grouping#surface-group`, `pattern.mobile-layout#responsive-collection`, `example.invoice-management`, the 15 component contracts, and the rules in `design/rules.json`) and the design decisions adopted.
   - Per CLAUDE.md, periodically save a markdown progress note in the project directory to survive context compaction.

8. Current Work:

   I had just written `src/InvoiceDetailPage.tsx` via a Bash heredoc (the write returned `ok`). Immediately before that I wrote, in order: `src/styles.css`, `src/invoice-presentation.ts`, `src/use-hash-navigation.ts`, `src/StatusChip.tsx`, `src/EmptyState.tsx`, and `src/InvoiceListPage.tsx`.

